' --- Administrator relationships ---
admin1 --> student1 : manages
admin1 --> supInst1 : registers lecturer
admin1 --> assignment1 : may assign via grid


' --- Student registration and documents ---
student1 --> reg1 : registers
student1 --> assumption1 : submits assumption
student1 --> orientation1 : completes
student1 *-- elogWeek1 : maintains
student1 *-- elogWeek2 : maintains
student1 --> contract1 : uploads
student1 --> report1 : submits
student1 --> visitSelect1 : selects visit
student1 --> supRequest1 : requested supervisor
student1 --> issueReport1 : reported issue
student1 --> notif1 : receives
student1 --> finalGrade1 : receives


' --- Supervisor relationships ---
supInst1 --> student1 : supervises
supInst1 --> assignment1 : assigned to
supInst1 --> visitAvail1 : publishes
supInst1 --> visitGrade1 : enters visit 1
supInst1 --> visitGrade2 : enters visit 2
supInst1 --> supMarks1 : enters marks
supInst1 --> assessPwd1 : generates
supInst1 --> supRequest1 : approved
supInst1 --> issueReport1 : acknowledged


' --- Visit scheduling chain ---
visitAvail1 --> visitSelect1 : contains
visitAvail1 ..> notif1 : triggers


' --- Assessment chain ---
companyAssessor1 --> companyGrade1 : submits via password
assessPwd1 ..> companyAssessor1 : authenticates
visitGrade1 ..> finalGrade1 : contributes
visitGrade2 ..> finalGrade1 : contributes
companyGrade1 ..> finalGrade1 : contributes
supMarks1 ..> finalGrade1 : contributes


' --- Placement context (assumption replaces old Placement + Company) ---
assumption1 ..> companyAssessor1 : company contact
reg1 ..> assumption1 : student context


' --- Vertical layout hints ---
admin1 -[hidden]down- student1
student1 -[hidden]down- reg1
reg1 -[hidden]down- assumption1
assumption1 -[hidden]down- elogWeek1
elogWeek1 -[hidden]down- contract1
contract1 -[hidden]down- supInst1
supInst1 -[hidden]down- visitAvail1
visitAvail1 -[hidden]down- visitGrade1
visitGrade1 -[hidden]down- companyGrade1
companyGrade1 -[hidden]down- finalGrade1
finalGrade1 -[hidden]down- notif1


legend bottom
  Updates from original object diagram:
  - Placement + Company replaced by AssumptionOfDuty + IndustrialRegistration
  - SiteVisit replaced by VisitAvailability + VisitSelection (publish then select)
  - Company Supervisor is CompanyAssessor (password access, no portal login)
  - Assessment split into visit grades, company grade, supervisor marks, and FinalGrade
  - Added OrientationChecklist, StudentContract, SupervisorAssignmentRequest, StudentIssueReport
endlegend

@enduml
